TITLE Equilibration of pure water with fixed-pressure gas phase at 150 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
    C(4) 0
    C(-4) 0
    N(-3) 0
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -temperature 150
    -pressure 1
    CH4(g) 0 10
    CO2(g) 0 10
    NH3(g) 0 5
END
